######## comm2: originates-from・community の条件・delete community in
configure
route-policy T-CUST
% WARNING: Policy object route-policy T-CUST exists! Reconfiguring it via CLI will replace current definition. Use abort to cancel.
if as-path originates-from '65201' then
pass
endif
end-policy
commit
end
